        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our instant shifting estimate system processes your request within 15‑30 minutes. After you submit basic details—origin, destination, inventory size, and preferred moving date—the algorithm cross‑checks fleet availability, distance, and current traffic conditions. You receive a detailed quote via email or SMS, complete with cost breakdown and optional service add‑ons.</p>
