        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 100% insured service provides IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers the full declared value of your household goods. At booking, you declare the total value of items; the premium is calculated as a small percentage of that amount. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, you can file a claim within 30 days, and we coordinate the settlement directly with the insurer, ensuring swift reimbursement.</p>
